    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Whether the boom lasts depends on subsidies, track access charges and a stubborn shortage of carriages. For now, the trains keep filling up."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
